{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B.A.N.K. \u2014 Balance? Account? No, Kidding!</strong><br><i>(A cooperative (1-2 players) bank employee simulator with elements of humor and horror)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a new employee at <strong>B.A.N.K.</strong> (<span class=\"bb_strike\">the official acronym is classified</span>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Your task</strong> is to serve clients from all corners of the universe. Deposits, loans, currency exchange, document checks \u2014 this is now your daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 To earn money and keep the bank afloat, you must maintain order and uphold <strong>B.A.N.K.'s reputation!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>B.A.N.K.</strong> is one of the few places offering financial services. But only clients <strong>chosen by the BOSS</strong> can enter. Check documents carefully and get rid of unwanted guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Two-player co-op:</strong> Earn money together, and one day, you might even <strong>take over B.A.N.K. with a friend!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589010?t=1755844602","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589010?t=1755844602","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589010/4487c9ba5e6f05b22fb3e05d3250dc51954962fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755844602","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589010/4487c9ba5e6f05b22fb3e05d3250dc51954962fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755844602","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"contr